{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fd32746a-6337-873b-bc25-dadc25c420ac",
  "created_at": "2025-12-31T13:01:39-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kwame Mensah",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:59:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:59:32-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good afternoon. Um, I'm calling about the plowing. The plow came down my street this morning and left a wall of snow across the end of my driveway. Hard, heavy stuff, up to my knees almost."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:59:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's a pain. Is it one of those walls where you shovel out and then it just comes right back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:59:53-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I shoveled it out already, once. That's the thing. Cleared the whole driveway, went in for my coffee, and then the plow came by again and put it right back. So now I get to do it twice. Lovely."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:00:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, no, I hear that a lot after a storm. What street are you on, sir?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:00:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'd rather not go into the street over the phone, if it's all the same. I just want it written down that it happened. Can you log it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:00:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can log it. Without an address the crew supervisor can't send anybody to look, but I can note the complaint with your name and a callback number so it's on record. Would that work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:00:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That'll do. Kwame Mensah. M-E-N-S-A-H."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:00:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And the number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:00:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:00:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-seven. Perfect. So I'm putting down plow left a wall of snow across the end of the driveway, after you'd already cleared it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:00:52-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And I'll tell you, I don't have much time to be out there. I trade shifts with my cousin, and I have to be back by noon on these days. Well, it's past that now, so I'm late already, but that's why I'm calling in a hurry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:01:09-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll get this noted right now. One thing that helps, if you can, is to push the snow to the right side as you face the street, so the plow throws it away from you. It's not a fix, but it helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:01:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've tried that. Fine. Just log it, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:01:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's logged. If you decide to give me the address later, call back and we'll add it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:01:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm-hm. Thank you, Denise. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:01:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Mensah. Happy New Year's Eve."
    }
  ],
